Package: scChromatic
Title: Reproducible Color Systems for Single-Cell Data Visualization
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Shaojun", "Xie", email = "xies4@nih.gov",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(
               ORCID = "0000-0002-6719-9814",
               Affiliation = "FNLCR",
               "Alternate email" = "xieshaojun0526@gmail.com"
           ))
Description: Reproducible, provenance-aware, and accessible color systems for
    single-cell data visualization. Persistent mappings keep labels stable
    across subsets and reordered factors, while palette diagnostics and
    recommendations support categorical annotations, expression, signed
    scores, pseudotime, quality-control metrics, and heatmaps.
